# The icon size setting and the folder search that is a button until it is wanted.
# The header row's buttons are flat and as compact as the title bar's; the choice scales them all.

tree .
refresh
assert-count 8

# Folded: a magnifier button, no box.
assert-visible SearchButton
assert-hidden SearchBox
shot 01-compact

# Clicking it opens the box and hands it the keyboard; Esc on an empty box folds it back.
press SearchButton
assert-visible SearchBox
assert-hidden SearchButton
window-key Esc
settle 300
assert-hidden SearchBox
assert-visible SearchButton

# A search that is running keeps the box open, even once it has lost the keyboard.
search report
assert-visible SearchBox
assert-hidden SearchButton
clear-search
assert-hidden SearchBox

icon-size Small
shot 02-small
icon-size Medium
shot 03-medium
icon-size Large
press SearchButton
shot 04-large-open
window-key Esc
settle 300
icon-size Compact
shot 05-compact-again
assert-not-launched
